<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3802/07  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.7247/50  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.9400/10  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4340/50  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     35.58/59   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.8180/95  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1686.8/7.8 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     113.28/31  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.6671/45  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.2565/15  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.5716/26  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One sterling     US$1.6657/62</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$338.30/60</p>
</text>
